ag-cute-music (1.3.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added a USB position to the amplifier's output selector, a menu of them
    (last used first) when more than one is plugged in
  * Bigger output icons around the amplifier's output selector
  * Detect audio inputs and outputs plugged in while running
  * Restart a mic input that stalls or opens silent (USB mics)
  * Fix a crash when an input left the mixer

