ag-cute-music (1.2.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added analog needle VU meters to the mixer, calibrated as the amplifier's
  * Added left and right channel mute to the Local Library strip
  * Moved the MUTE buttons under the faders
  * Show each participant's left and right levels for stereo rooms
  * Amplifier VOLUME no longer moves the VU meters
  * MUTE empties the strip's meter at once
  * Fix high CPU use with the needle meters
  * Bug fixes

